(99, 'Aykiz', 'Momin', 'Female', '08/14/2022', 'Primary', '', '', '', '', '', '2515 June Bug St', 'Richmond', 'TX', '77406', 'Saaiqa Maredia Momin', '4808404304', 'saaiqazm@gmail.com', 'Abid Momin', '8327980655', 'abidmomin4811@gmail.com', 'phone', '04/21/2025', '10:00AM-10:30AM', 'No', 'When selecting a Montessori school for our child, we are looking for a program that adheres closely to authentic Montessori principles while also offering a rigorous academic curriculum. We value a thoughtful balance between child-led exploration and instructor-guided learning to foster both independence and strong academic foundations. Key priorities for us include AMI- or AMS-certified teachers, a well-prepared classroom environment with hands-on materials, and mixed-age groupings that encourage collaboration and leadership. Equally important is a safe, nurturing environment that supports our child’s social-emotional development and well-being. We also appreciate open, consistent communication between educators and parents. We’d love to learn more about how your program incorporates these values.', 'Drive-By', '', '', '04/21/2025', 'schoolday', 'Primary', 'https://harvestgreenmontessori.com/uploads/signatures/default_signature.png', 1, '2025-04-15 23:09:05'),
