(137, 'Renessmee', 'Chaudhri Montano', 'Female', '07/24/2019', 'K', 'Jaan ', 'Chaudhri Montano', 'Male', '10/13/2020', 'K', '4818 Highland Springs Dr', 'Richmond', 'Texas', '77469', 'Genesis Montano', '8329333600', 'chaudhrimontano@teachers.org', 'Hamza Chaudhri', '8328682910', 'chaudhrimontano@teachers.org', 'email', '07/31/2025', '4:00PM-4:30PM', 'No', 'I am especially drawn to schools that:\r\n	•	Offer a warm, respectful, and child-centered environment\r\n	•	Follow authentic Montessori or Christian-based learning approaches\r\n	•	Have small class ratios to ensure personalized attention\r\n	•	Provide clear and open communication with parents (ideally with camera access or regular updates but not required)\r\n	•	Are flexible with families with immunization exemptions due to personal or religious beliefs\r\n	\r\n\r\nOur family is faith-based and values kindness, discipline with grace, and a strong foundation in both character and early academics. I’d love to learn more about your school’s philosophy, daily structure, and enrollment availability for this upcoming year.', 'Internet', '', '', '07/29/2025', 'schoolday', 'Primary,Kindergarten', 'https://harvestgreenmontessori.com/uploads/signatures/default_signature.png', 1, '2025-07-30 04:39:18'),
