(139, 'Tatum', 'Davies', 'Male', '01/23/2023', 'transition', '', '', '', '', '', '30109 Redwood Peak Lane', 'Brookshire', 'Texas', '77423', 'Caitlin Davies', '7029549094', 'daviescaite@gmail.com', 'Nathan Davies', '7029549094', 'daviescaite@gmail.com', 'email', '08/06/2025', '10:30AM-11:00AM', 'no', 'Safety and fun. The curriculum can change and so can his focus, but learning is most impactful when it is fun. I expect all Montessori schools to uphold a level of cleanliness, so that is a given.', 'Internet', '', 'Hi! I am a yoga studio lead for Sky Yoga and Coffee in Harvest Green. I am looking at moving us to an apartment in the area in October, if not sooner.  I am recently divorced and live out of state from Tate\'s dad. Tate and I are living with my parents temporarily. Once Tate is enrolled in a program, I would be happy to promptly advise his Dad and update his contact information. Depending on my schedule at the studio, his time could be school day instead of full day. We love the area and are so excited to come see you all!', '08/02/2025', 'fullday', 'Transition', 'https://harvestgreenmontessori.com/uploads/signatures/default_signature.png', 1, '2025-08-03 08:16:09'),
